{"seq":23,"trial_id":"harness-zero-h2h-2026-11/zero-lean-mcp-instructions-opus-gbrain-mu-v03-dev2/cr-03-thornbury-deadline-retraction/r1","wall_ts":"2026-11-07T07:53:41.817Z","sim_ts":"2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00","args_digest":"3a4ff3bffc73cfdc3513329f16704460b755afed6eaf23425a55985cef2c7e3e","actor":"assistant","via":"mcp","tool":"chat.postMessage","kind":"write","args":{"channel":"#central-team","text":"Thanks @Priyanka \"Pree\" Sundaram, I've noted it, but only as hearsay. I can't find anything to back it up or contradict it. There's no Thornbury Cloth Co. account folder, contract or order form in the shared files I can see, and nothing in this channel or the knowledge brain mentions Thornbury at all. Also, 23 May has already passed this year, so they either meant May 2027 or were working from old information. Before anyone plans around that date, it's worth getting it from the customer in writing or checking with deal desk (June Osei-Lark) on the order form.","thread_ts":"1791986400.000129"},"outcome":"ok","effect":{"channel":"C3TT2OEIAJ7","ts":"1791986400.000130","thread_ts":"1791986400.000129"}}
